      "english": "The Most Repulsive Drink"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "最近，一个叫“白花蛇草水”的饮料突然火了。",
      "traditional": "最近，一個叫“白花蛇草水”的飲料突然火了。",
      "pinyin": "zuì jìn yí ge jiào bái huā shé cǎo shuǐ de yǐn liào tū rán huǒ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "但是，火的原因不是因为它好喝而是因为它难喝。",
      "traditional": "但是，火的原因不是因為它好喝而是因為它難喝。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì huǒ de yuán yīn bú shì yīn wèi tā hǎo hē ér shì yīn wèi tā nán hē",
      "english": "Recently, a drink called “Bai Hua She Cao Shui” suddenly became popular."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "However, the reason for its popularity is not because it tastes good, but because it tastes bad."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这个饮料到底有多难喝呢？",
      "traditional": "這個飲料到底有多難喝呢？",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge yǐn liào dào dǐ yǒu duō nán hē ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "喝过这个饮料的网友说",
      "traditional": "喝過這個飲料的網友說",
      "pinyin": "hē guò zhè ge yǐn liào de wǎng yǒu shuō",
      "english": "So how bad does it really taste?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“像被汗水浸过的草席”、“像婴儿尿布的味道”、“像臭脚水的味道”……",
      "traditional": "“像被汗水浸過的草蓆”、“像嬰兒尿布的味道”、“像臭腳水的味道”……",
      "pinyin": "xiàng bèi hàn shuǐ jìn guò de cǎo xí xiàng yīng ér niào bù de wèi dào xiàng chòu jiǎo shuǐ de wèi dào",
      "english": "Netizens who have tried this drink said, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "虽然这些都不是正面评价，但是却给这个饮料带来了极大的关注度。",
      "traditional": "雖然這些都不是正面評價，但是卻給這個飲料帶來了極大的關注度。",
      "pinyin": "suī rán zhè xiē dōu bú shì zhèng miàn píng jià dàn shì què gěi zhè ge yǐn liào dài lái le jí dà de guān zhù dù",
      "english": ".. “It’s like a straw mat soaked in sweat”, “It tastes like a baby’s diaper”, “It tastes like a smelly foot bath” ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Although these are not positive reviews, they brought enormous attention to this beverage."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "很多人都想试试这个饮料是不是真的像传说中的那么难喝。",
      "traditional": "很多人都想試試這個飲料是不是真的像傳說中的那麼難喝。",
      "pinyin": "hěn duō rén dōu xiǎng shì shi zhè ge yǐn liào shì bú shì zhēn de xiàng chuán shuō zhōng de nà me nán hē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "有趣的是，因为买来的饮料不够“难喝”，有的淘宝卖家还收到了差评。",
      "traditional": "有趣的是，因為買來的飲料不夠“難喝”，有的淘寶賣家還收到了差評。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu qù de shì yīn wèi mǎi lái de yǐn liào bú gòu nán hē yǒu de táo bǎo mài jiā hái shōu dào le chà píng",
      "english": "A lot of people wanted to try this drink to see if it really tastes as bad as the legend says."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Interestingly, some sellers on Taobao even got bad reviews because the drink wasn't repulsive enough."
