    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Most Repulsive Drink",
      "",
      "Recently, a drink called “Bai Hua She Cao Shui” suddenly became popular.",
      "However, the reason for its popularity is not because it tastes good, but because it tastes bad.",
      "",
      "So how bad does it really taste?",
      "Netizens who have tried this drink said, ..",
      ".. “It’s like a straw mat soaked in sweat”, “It tastes like a baby’s diaper”, “It tastes like a smelly foot bath” ...",
      "Although these are not positive reviews, they brought enormous attention to this beverage.",
      "",
      "A lot of people wanted to try this drink to see if it really tastes as bad as the legend says.",
      "Interestingly, some sellers on Taobao even got bad reviews because the drink wasn't repulsive enough.",
      ""
    ]
